                    Repeated to Tokyo, Hong Kong, and Taipei.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d324-f2" n="2" xml:id="d324-f2-content">
                <p>
                    Yost reported on the Secretary-General’s
                    press conference in telegram 138 from USUN,
                    January 18. (Ibid.)</p>
